INSERT INTO pending VALUES(44,'Measure in the BM25 retrieval phase (user decision, 2026-11-02): tokenizer options for identifiers, always applied the same way to files and queries, splitting snake_case and CamelCase first and lowercasing after. o1 split only (baseline); o2 whole lowercase token plus its parts only for candidates, meaning words with an inner capital that also exist whole in lowercase in the corpus (275 of 5398 measured, e.g. vLLM, OpenAI, LoRA, MoE; high idf was rejected as the signal because it selects one-off names); o3 whole token plus parts for every identifier. For each option check that the chunk ranges stay identical (tokenization runs after chunking, so no change is expected) and measure recall@5 on docs and code, tokens per chunk and search_dataset time. Keep o1 unless another option improves recall@5. If a candidate list wins, store it in each index version so queries use the same list.','2026-11-02',0);
